# .nightly/branches: the ordered list of branches that ride `nightly`.
#
# nightly = the default branch + these branches, merged in this order, rebuilt
# from scratch by .github/workflows/nightly-rebuild.yml. Docs:
# https://github.com/kvnloo/verified-oss-loop/blob/main/docs/nightly.md
#
# One entry per line:   <branch>  <mode>  <owner>  # optional note
#   mode   required  tests must pass or the branch is dropped (default)
#          advisory  merged even when its tests fail; the failure is reported
#   owner  bot tag: claude-code, grok, muse, omp, hermes, cursor, codex, kevin, ...
#          It drives the report only. It never grants merge authority.
#
# Order matters. List a stack's TIP first; lower layers then report CONTAINED.
# Graduation to the default branch stays a reviewed PR per branch.
#
# branch                                mode      owner        note
